    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Made of the sturdy, thick hide of the aurochs and tempered to be both flexible and durable, this "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "+1 resilient hide armor",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is imbued with the aurochs' natural defenses against venomous predators. You gain resistance 5 to poison damage."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate—Stubborn Skin",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "one"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You pull the layers of the armor taut, stiffening your body against incoming forces for 1 minute. While the armor is taut, you have a –1 penalty to Reflex saves and a +2 item bonus to Fortitude saves."
          }
        ]
      },
